# The image builds from the repository root and copies exactly two things: the
# assembled distribution directory and the shared console log4j2 config.
# Everything else is context the daemon would tar up for nothing — without this
# file that is well over 500 MB, most of it target/ directories.
#
# So: exclude everything, then re-admit only what the Dockerfile COPYs.
*

!docker/log4j2-console.properties
!assembly/target/tools.assembly-*-dist
!assembly/target/tools.assembly-*-dist/**
